    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banner of Conquest</strong> is a survivors-like game set against the backdrop of the Three Kingdoms period. In this game, you will take on the role of a famous general from the Three Kingdoms, growing stronger through relentless battles. Activate the power of your inner martial soul, face increasingly powerful foes, and strive to dominate the Central Plains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/ffdae088556829cfd328cd22c08caaed.poster.avif?t=1745463627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/ffdae088556829cfd328cd22c08caaed.webm?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/ffdae088556829cfd328cd22c08caaed.mp4?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/02d0879ddebd5a4594ba0008c3a704e9.avif?t=1745463627\" /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from nearly 20 famous Three Kingdoms generals, each with unique skills to match your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/002c718468b6efd17a22fdb99543e42e.poster.avif?t=1745463627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/002c718468b6efd17a22fdb99543e42e.webm?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/002c718468b6efd17a22fdb99543e42e.mp4?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from dozens of different weapons. A special weapon crafting system allows even simple blades to be upgraded into legendary weapons with immense power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/f0a7b0855d4a77f11c8c23d2936e4f33.poster.avif?t=1745463627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/f0a7b0855d4a77f11c8c23d2936e4f33.webm?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/f0a7b0855d4a77f11c8c23d2936e4f33.mp4?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the ever-changing battlefield, you'll need to quickly dodge enemy attacks and carve a path through the chaos. Defeat enemies to collect resources, and use these to purchase new weapons and gear before the next wave arrives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/28113538cf5bf9cf6f114096930b3805.poster.avif?t=1745463627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/28113538cf5bf9cf6f114096930b3805.webm?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/28113538cf5bf9cf6f114096930b3805.mp4?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your Three Kingdoms journey, conquer the five passes, defeat six generals, and see if you have what it takes to rule the Central Plains.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banner of Conquest</strong> is a survivors-like game set against the backdrop of the Three Kingdoms period. In this game, you will take on the role of a famous general from the Three Kingdoms, growing stronger through relentless battles. Activate the power of your inner martial soul, face increasingly powerful foes, and strive to dominate the Central Plains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/ffdae088556829cfd328cd22c08caaed.poster.avif?t=1745463627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/ffdae088556829cfd328cd22c08caaed.webm?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/ffdae088556829cfd328cd22c08caaed.mp4?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/02d0879ddebd5a4594ba0008c3a704e9.avif?t=1745463627\" /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from nearly 20 famous Three Kingdoms generals, each with unique skills to match your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/002c718468b6efd17a22fdb99543e42e.poster.avif?t=1745463627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/002c718468b6efd17a22fdb99543e42e.webm?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/002c718468b6efd17a22fdb99543e42e.mp4?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from dozens of different weapons. A special weapon crafting system allows even simple blades to be upgraded into legendary weapons with immense power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/f0a7b0855d4a77f11c8c23d2936e4f33.poster.avif?t=1745463627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/f0a7b0855d4a77f11c8c23d2936e4f33.webm?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/f0a7b0855d4a77f11c8c23d2936e4f33.mp4?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the ever-changing battlefield, you'll need to quickly dodge enemy attacks and carve a path through the chaos. Defeat enemies to collect resources, and use these to purchase new weapons and gear before the next wave arrives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/28113538cf5bf9cf6f114096930b3805.poster.avif?t=1745463627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/28113538cf5bf9cf6f114096930b3805.webm?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/28113538cf5bf9cf6f114096930b3805.mp4?t=1745463627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your Three Kingdoms journey, conquer the five passes, defeat six generals, and see if you have what it takes to rule the Central Plains.</p>",
